{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。Y在S05、S08省略了此前对方持续接纳他的背景，心理因果承接不如X完整，部分感受词也略有重复堆叠。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的加亮关键词让观众能迅速抓住每段的心理变化，感受文字缩小并随音乐时点出现，减少了同时阅读的负担。反复出现的水面、小船、波浪等意象也让十四段形成统一的感官脉络，细腻程度和音乐同步感更强。X的心理因果解释更完整，尤其是人物为何收敛、为何放松、为何再次害怕失去，但整体更像需要阅读的文字说明，而不是适合边听边扫的屏幕。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bd830712-e0a9-47aa-8280-843fc5e73cfb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T075835379073Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.157, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:59:41.543956+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "32a34019edb0ca3dd42d011ee26a7918a42cf2a69ae3d84e286e985e61efec23", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "e